msgstr ""

#: eg-social-timeline.php:814
msgid "Single color (same as the post text)"
msgstr ""

#: eg-social-timeline.php:818
msgid "The SVG icons are monochrome outlines and carry no color of their own: the stylesheet paints them. Platform colors use the official color of each platform, lightened when the surface is dark. A single color follows the post text, so the icons turn white on a dark card. Default: Platform colors"
msgstr ""

